// SaysList :
"P2316783576" "How noble of you, letting your little friend in the PPD sacrifice himself. It won't matter though. We'll kill him off shortly."
// SaysList :
"P538114910" "What motivated you, {HeroName}, to force that man out of Praetoria? Kindness? Self-preservation?"
// SaysList :
"P1310453522" "This all important list...you don't realize how important it truly is. This is the Syndicate's key to winning the war, to uniting all sides!"
// SaysList :
"P3220693351" "You claim to be fighting for freedom, but look at what you've done, forced a man to be 'free', against his own will!"
// SaysList :
"P624774606" "Even without the Resistance, we will figure out a way to topple Cole and his regime. And then, we will kill Marino and send his head to you. If you still live, that is."
// SaysList :
"P3754413" "This, {HeroName}, is why the Resistance is not fit to save Praetoria. Only we in the Syndicate are!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - Suit 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Description :
"P348874365" "Defeat Daniel Shapiro"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - Objective 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P619177009" "You've defeated Daniel Shapiro and found the list that he was holding!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2686133415" "You've saved the Resistance from the hands of the Syndicate!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P19519493" "<color BurlyWood>>Ah...haven't felt relieved in a long time, really long time, just the sense of being able to relax a bit. I don't really care about what went down with Paolo, but I'm really happy about this list being in <i>our</i> hands. You really helped me out, {HeroName}, I'm sorry that I thought you smelled like a traitor, really I am, since you're not a traitor at all, at least not yet, still could turn on us I guess, but that's the way life works.<br><br>I told Vetrano that I don't want any more big assignments like this because of all the stress, I really can't stand all of this stuff of responsibility being put on my shoulders. Too much to worry about, piled ontop of things that I'm already worrying about, it's just not good for me.<br><br>I've got one last thing for you though, then I can relax, finally.<br><br>There's a doctor, named Arvin, he wants your help in some sort of experiment of his. Arvin's a good guy, kind of, smells alright, kind of like medicine, but good medicine, not bad. Friend of us in the Resistance, helped actually patch me up a few times. If you can help him, that would be good, unless you're a traitor, then that would be bad."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
